The fonts in this repository are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, not the
MIT License below:

  ScienceGothicMono.ttf
  ScienceGothicMono-Bold.ttf

They are modified versions of Science Gothic (Copyright 2024 Font Detective
LLC), generated by mkmono.py. The full license is in OFL.txt and is also
carried in each file's name table. The carve-out is required rather than tidy:
OFL 1.1 section 5 says the Font Software "must be distributed entirely under
this license, and must not be distributed under any other license", so an MIT
grant reaching those two files would conflict with it. Upstream declares no
Reserved Font Name, which is why "Science Gothic Mono" is a permissible name
for a modified version.

MaterialIconTheme.ttf and material-icons.tsv are built by mkicons.py from
Material Icon Theme (https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme),
which is under the MIT License with a copyright holder of its own: Copyright
(c) 2025 Material Extensions. Its license is in MIT-material-icon-theme.txt and
in the font's name table, and that notice, not the one below, is the one those
two files carry.

Everything else (mkmono.py, mkicons.py, the CI) is under the MIT License.

